<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx1.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="In A. GTR Generation ‣ DynamicGTR: Leveraging Graph Topology Representation Preferences to Boost VLM Capabilities on Graph QAs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">More Details for Visual GTRs Generation</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx1.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In A. GTR Generation ‣ DynamicGTR: Leveraging Graph Topology Representation Preferences to Boost VLM Capabilities on Graph QAs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">More Details for Textual GTRs Generation</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
