<span id="Sx6.T14.3.1.8.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Sx6.T14.3.1.8.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Q: Begin with node 0, what is the path in this graph that visits every node exactly once?</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="Sx6.T14.3.1.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="Sx6.T14.3.1.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
